{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Meets Sandra"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Evaluation Form"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le07ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Evaluation Form"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "An evaluation form is a form you complete after someone has presented a workshop or seminar.<br/>You give your opinion about the quality of the presentation.<br/><br/>Often, you have to circle number 1-5, 1 being most negative and 5 being the most positive.<br/><br/>Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">Would you recommend this course to others? .................. 1 2 3 <span class=\"strong\">4</span> 5 6</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hold someone's interest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep someone's attention "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Was your interest held at the presentation?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you are doing outside activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to handle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to deal with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How did you handle difficult customers?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a judgment about the quality, ability, or value of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you rate the presentation?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disgruntled"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is discontented and unhappy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The disgruntled customers started yelling at the crew."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "loyalty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a feeling of strong support for someone or something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some customers really like loyalty programs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Opinions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>When you complete an evaluation form, you give your opinion about products and the service you receive.</p> Here are some examples of how to give an opinion.<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I felt ... </li><li>I think/thought ...</li><li>I enjoyed/I didn't enjoy ... </li><li>I would recommend/I would not recommend ...</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I felt that the employees were not trained properly."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I thought that the speech was excellent but the room was too noisy."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I enjoyed the lunch. It was delicious!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would recommend the course to other employees. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create an evaluation form based on this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 key points you want to rate. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go to a restaurant or store and rate the customer service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give the each key point a rating out of 5."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a sentence on each key point based on your opinion."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create an evaluation form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down five key points I want to rate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give a restaurant or store a rating out of 5."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my opinion."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le07ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: That concludes the presentation on customer service.</br>My assistant, Simone, will be handing out an evaluation form for you to complete.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: That was fantastic, Sandra. You really know your stuff.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: Thanks, John. I worked in customer service for a long time.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le07ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: How long did you work for Diego's? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: Six years. I spent three years as a tour guide and two years in management.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I particularly liked when you spoke about disgruntled customers.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: Dealing with unhappy people is always a challenge. Patience and clear communication is key.", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn5le07ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Also, your ideas about loyalty programs were a hit with the group.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: They seem to encourage customers to come back year after year.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I would definitely recommend anyone in hospitality to come to this presentation.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: I hope you include this in your evaluation form.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: You bet! Aren't we all meeting up in the conferenc